
READme:

The original datasets obtained from authors are in the folder titled Originals:

From Sivakoff et al 2018:
- bee bowl species list[...] : the bees collected through bee bowl trapping
- Master_VisitationFreq : The bees collected through bee vacuuming

From Turo et al 2021:
- Collected Bees (raw data, pan traps) trt : The bees collected through pan traps
- 2015NetworkFreq_Turo : The bees vacuumed in 2015
- 2016NetworkFreq : The bees vacuumed in 2016
- Turo_network : a list of the plant species IDed in each treatment 

From Pham et al (in review)
-SpecimenDataset : The bee specimen collected as part of Pham et al 2019 (the confirmed ID tab is what we used)



To accurately consolidate the data from these original author files I created files titled Namescorrected- etc. 
Within these files:
- misspelled species names were corrected
-Site names occasionally named differently within the dataset were consolidated
- vacuum and pan trap/bee bowl data were combined onto one data sheet
- Hylaeus affinis and modestus were combined into Hylaeusaffinismodestus
- A pivot table was created at the beginning of the datasets to make consolidating presence absence data for all three authors simpler


More specifically-

-Sivakoff et al had all Frontier labels renamed as 47th street garden, because they were the same location. An individual labelled lasioglossum mendica was removed, because that is not a species that exists. Several other species with the species name misspelled were corrected. ex: Megachile montivaga was misspelled montiraga 

- Turo et al had Coelioxys alternatus mispelled as alternata
Hylaeus.leptocephalus and Hylaeus.pictipes had some individuals misspelled Hylaues.leptocephalus and Hylaues.pictipes.A few other mispellings corrected
Dialictus was removed from the names of all lasioglossum species which had it

-Pham et al had T1-D and T1-DS listed as separate sites (same with FAT7-C and T8-C, T8-D and DS, T6 and T8 G). Bombus.pensylvanicus was mispelled, as was Heriades.carinata, Lasioglossum.leucocomus







